5/1161684187456475136903524.jpeg/thyNhYeRj1NX53rYpTj1yPiuHXdt0MwAnQpis50KYrM\"/><figcaption>i-dle曺薇娟（IG@noodle.zip）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"i-dle曺薇娟（IG@noodle.zip）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260805/1161684177880354816937148.jpeg/84OI8TVVO7ejE_XwOQolRyOJnxSYSU06S_NRVkvzUVY\"/><figcaption>i-dle曺薇娟（IG@noodle.zip）</figcaption></figure><p>Fed暗示利率凍結黃金本周有望收紅　金價單日飆漲逾2%近4,460美元</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-05T06:18:23.957933+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1934,"images":38,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}